OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London is named by police
OL,6,FA 25-year-old bus driver shot dead
OL,7,Foutside a pub in south London has been
OL,8,Fnamed by police.
OL,10,FGunshots were heard near the venue in
OL,11,FWillington Road, Clapham, on Monday
OL,12,Fevening.
OL,14,FAuguste-Marie Bile-aka Amoa was named
OL,15,Fby the Metropolitan Police as the
OL,16,Fvictim of the attack.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
