OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786600070
OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London is named by police
OL,6,FShortly after the shooting, a 22-year-
OL,7,Fold man attended hospital with a
OL,8,Fgunshot wound and was arrested on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of murder, according to the
OL,10,Fforce.
OL,12,FHe remains in hospital under police
OL,13,Fguard, they said.
OL,15,F"Our thoughts remain with Bile-aka's
OL,16,Ffamily as they come to terms with this
OL,17,Ftragic incident," said detective chief
OL,18,Finspector Claire Guiver, who is
OL,19,Fleading the investigation.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
