CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786600070
OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London is named by police
OL,6,F"We continue to appeal for anyone with
OL,7,Finformation to come forward.
OL,9,F"If you were in the area at the time
OL,10,Fof the shooting, witnessed anything
OL,11,Fsuspicious or have any CCTV, dashcam
OL,12,For doorbell footage that could assist
OL,13,Four investigation, we urge you to get
OL,14,Fin touch.
OL,16,F"Any piece of information could prove
OL,17,Fvital in helping us piece together the
OL,18,Ffull circumstances."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
