OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London is named by police
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FSpeaking near the scene, a friend of
OL,12,Fthe Bile-aka described him as a "cool
OL,13,Fguy", adding that he believed his
OL,14,Fdeath was the result of "wrong place,
OL,15,Fwrong time".
OL,17,FHe said: "I don't have bad things to
OL,18,Fsay about him", adding: "It's shocking
OL,19,Fbecause of who he is and his
OL,20,Fcharacter."
