OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London is named by police
OL,6,FThe man, who also works as a bus
OL,7,Fdriver, said Bile-aka's death was
OL,8,F"going to hurt a lot of people".
OL,10,FA police forensics tent was still in
OL,11,Fplace across the road from The Landor
OL,12,Fpub on Tuesday, while several bouquets
OL,13,Fof flowers were laid and a candle was
OL,14,Flit near its entrance.
OL,16,FStaff from The Landor are understood
OL,17,Fto have helped the Bile-aka after the
OL,18,Fshooting.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
