OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London is named by police
OL,6,FA woman, 26, living nearby said she
OL,7,Fheard four gunshots and initially
OL,8,Fthought it was the sound of a car
OL,9,Fbackfiring.
OL,11,FTwo other residents described hearing
OL,12,Ffour gunshots at around 10pm on Monday
OL,13,Fand seeing a car with a broken window.
OL,15,FOne man, who did not wish to be named,
OL,16,Fsaid he heard three gunshots and saw
OL,17,Fsomeone run out of the pub and shout
OL,18,F"call the police".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
