OL,3,CBus driver, 25, shot dead outside pub
OL,4,Cin south London is named by police
OL,6,FHe said he saw a moped and white car
OL,7,Fdrive off before the police arrived,
OL,8,Fand that women could be heard
OL,9,F"screaming and crying" outside.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
